[00:00.00] 作词 : the Huiting 陳惠婷
[00:01.00] 作曲 : the Huiting 陳惠婷
[00:08.30]我的世界是场怪人秀
[00:11.74]每个人骄傲地展示缺憾
[00:15.43]残酷 诡异 却又华丽绚烂
[00:19.05]夺目的光彩让人迷幻
[00:25.24]舍不得不看
[00:34.11]我是最忧郁的Frankenstin
[00:37.67]畸形地追求理想的爱
[00:41.30]却忘记纯粹的笨拙情感
[00:44.99]有时候反而造成伤害
[00:50.98]喔多么孤单
[00:54.67]想有人陪伴
[00:58.42]可他们总说
[01:00.23]你 不属于这里
[01:02.98]这游戏规则对你太难
[01:07.99]你奇怪地彻底
[01:10.17]谁在乎你拿心交换
[01:14.11]but love is for the pretty one,
[01:17.61]but love is for the freaky one,
[01:21.36]but love is equal, baby,
[01:24.11]for all mankind.
[01:28.86]but love is for the pretty one,
[01:32.42]but love is for the freaky one,
[01:36.11]but love is equal, darling,
[01:38.92]for all mankind.
[02:21.94]世界总会给我个相衬的人去相爱
[02:29.36]不论多么奇怪 在他的眼里是最可爱
[02:35.23]but love is for the pretty one,
[02:38.98]but love is for the freaky one,
[02:42.61]but love is equal, baby,
[02:45.29]for all mankind.
[02:50.11]but love is for the pretty one,
[02:53.67]but love is for the freaky one,
[02:57.42]but love is equal, darling,
[03:00.10]for all mankind,
[03:02.61]so nice,
[03:04.86]but love is for the funky one,
[03:08.48]but love is for the dreamy one,
[03:12.18]and love is the best thing
[03:13.95]we can share tonight.
[03:17.76]
